Fonts bundled with homely
=========================

All fonts in this directory come from the fonts/ directory of
https://github.com/hzeller/rpi-rgb-led-matrix (see README.hzeller.md).

* 4x6, 5x7, 5x8, 6x9, 6x10, 6x12, 6x13, 6x13B, 7x13, 7x13B, 8x13, 9x15, 9x18, 10x20
  are from the X11 "misc-fixed" family maintained by Markus Kuhn.
  License: "Public domain font. Share and enjoy."
  https://www.cl.cam.ac.uk/~mgk25/ucs-fonts.html

* tom-thumb.bdf by Robey Pointer (based on work by Brian Swetland).
  License: MIT (also released under CC0 / CC-BY 3.0 by the author).
  https://robey.lag.net/2010/01/23/tiny-monospace-font.html

The files may have been trimmed to a subset of their original glyph ranges
(see scripts/trim_fonts.py) to keep the package small; no glyphs were modified.
